RUN: %COMPILE %S/declarations.st %S/actions.st && %RUN | %CHECK %s

The action lives in a separate file from its function block. Its parent cannot take the BOOL
temporary a short-circuit operand would be lowered into, so the call argument keeps the eager fat
pointer preamble and the program still compiles and runs.

CHECK: bound = 0
CHECK-NEXT: bound = 1
